_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"5:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"5:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"5:34"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"5:34"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:34"}]},{"verse_key":"5:35","surah":5,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱبْتَغُوٓا۟ إِلَيْهِ ٱلْوَسِيلَةَ وَجَـٰهِدُوا۟ فِى سَبِيلِهِۦ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُفْلِحُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, be mindful of God, seek ways to come closer to Him and strive for His cause, so that you may prosper.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Fear","transliteration":"ittaqū","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱبْتَغُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and seek","transliteration":"wa-ib'taghū","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"towards Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْوَسِيلَةَ","en_gloss":"the means","transliteration":"l-wasīlata","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَجَـٰهِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"and strive hard","transliteration":"wajāhidū","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَبِيلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His way","transliteration":"sabīlihi","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"5:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تُفْلِحُونَ","en_gloss"